<title>FRANCE: Vallourec confirms higher profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Vallourec confirms higher profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French steel tube maker Vallourec confirmed at an annual shareholders' meeting on Tuesday that it expected an improved net consolidated result in 1997.</p>
<p>It confirmed an already stated forecast of an improvement this year and chief executive Jean-Claude Cabre also said he expected sales growth for the year to be about the same as in the first five months of the year, about 5.5 percent.</p>
</text>
